            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Cove 0.1.62</title></head><body><h1>Fixes Cove freezing on launch</h1><ul><li>Fixes 0.1.61 freezing right after it opens. If Cove froze for you, install this version from the website: open the DMG and drag Cove to Applications.</li><li>Your next meeting in the menu bar is back, now under its own Settings → Menu bar section. It's off by default.</li></ul><p>Nothing else changes.</p></body></html>
]]></description>
